  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Rockford collects a diamond: plays the sound, adds the diamond points to the score and counts the diamond."},
    {"at":26,"placement":"line","text":"Pushes the boulder by one cell to scan_ptr+Y with a chance of 1 in 4 and plays the boulder sound."},
    {"at":44,"placement":"line","text":"Examines the cell at scan_ptr+Y that Rockford moves to. Sets rockford_moved when Rockford can enter it and starts the step sound."},
    {"at":54,"placement":"side","text":"Step sound in space."},
    {"at":66,"placement":"side","text":"Step sound in dirt."},
    {"at":83,"placement":"side","text":"Rockford enters the open exit: the cave is complete."},
    {"at":101,"placement":"side","text":"Two cells to the left must be space."},
    {"at":128,"placement":"line","text":"Moves Rockford to scan_ptr+Y when the cell lets him in. With fire pressed he clears the cell and stays. Returns rockford_moved."},
    {"at":150,"placement":"side","text":"Scanned Rockford $39 in the new cell, space in the old cell."},
    {"at":165,"placement":"line","text":"Moves Rockford by the joystick bits in A: down, up, right, left. Updates rockford_col, rockford_row and rockford_facing."},
    {"at":171,"placement":"side","text":"No move down while Rockford is at view row 6 and the view scrolls up."},
    {"at":214,"placement":"side","text":"No move right while Rockford is at view column 8 and the view scrolls left."},
    {"at":259,"placement":"line","text":"Handler of Rockford $38. Reads the joystick of the current player, or the demo input, and moves Rockford."},
    {"at":263,"placement":"side","text":"Demo: the input that the demo player wrote."},
    {"at":289,"placement":"side","text":"Rockford is alive in this frame."}
  ],
